claim.claim-text:
- a limb support (31) for supporting a phalangeal limb;
- a driving rod (35), wherein the driving rod is movable for moving the interphalangeal implant towards the limb support; and
- an actuation mechanism (50) for actuating the driving rod;
the implant retainer comprising a jig part (21), wherein the jig part has a plate-shape and includes an implant aperture (22) for retaining an interphalangeal implant.
